# Ephemeral agent working state (ADR-008 / T-450)
.agents/plans/
.agents/archive/
.agents/worktree-leases/
.agents/scratch/

# Generated workspace terrain maps (regenerate: memory terrain --workspace)
# Live indexes of branch/HEAD/commit-log/file-counts go stale on every commit,
# and habits.md publishes a test count that contradicts claims.json (the
# authoritative source). Per ADR-008 this is derived per-agent state, tracked
# only where it is stable — standards, context, artifacts.
.agents/terrain/
